[ve:0.3.3]
[00:13.33]Love detected.
[00:16.09]Vulnerability detected.
[00:18.79]Threat detected.
[00:21.33]Heh…
[00:24.49]Laugh first.
[00:26.03]Bite first.
[00:26.99]Leave first.
[00:28.11]Never let them see
[00:30.34]what the joke is hiding.
[00:34.09]Need is weakness.
[00:36.19]Love is evidence.
[00:38.70]Anyone who finds it
[00:40.79]must disappear.
[00:43.36]You painted teeth across your face
[00:45.11]and called the terror charm,
[00:47.41]turned every open pair of hands
[00:49.14]into another arm to harm.
[00:51.91]You made a toy of everyone
[00:53.61]before they felt too real,
[00:56.13]because an object cannot leave
[00:58.46]and objects never make you feel.
[01:00.95]If I laugh before you laugh,
[01:02.56]you cannot make me small.
[01:05.33]If I push before you leave,
[01:07.61]I never lost at all.
[01:09.86]If I make you something small
[01:12.01]I can mock, control and move,
[01:14.28]I never have to say
[01:16.41]I was scared to lose you.
[01:19.76]Every joke became a lock.
[01:21.83]Every lock became a wall.
[01:24.15]Every wall became a kingdom
[01:25.83]with no living thing at all.
[01:29.11]Purple rabbit, 
[01:30.13]purple rabbit,
[01:30.98]laugh, laugh, laugh.
[01:33.58]Purple rabbit, 
[01:34.66]purple rabbit,
[01:35.38]bite, bite, bite.
[01:37.55]Laugh first.
[01:38.58]Bite first.
[01:39.61]Leave first.
[01:40.81]Never let them get inside.
[01:47.05]Purple rabbit, 
[01:47.98]purple rabbit,
[01:48.88]love became a crime.
[01:52.26]Laugh first.
[01:53.23]Bite first.
[01:53.65]Leave first.
[01:53.95]Leave them
[01:54.52]before they leave you behind.
[01:59.84]Laugh first.
[02:01.11]Bite first.
[02:02.36]Leave first.
[02:03.27]You were never invulnerable.
[02:07.32]You were only
[02:10.53]out of reach.
[02:13.96]The frog was real.
[02:14.87]The grief was real.
[02:15.24]The things you said were true.
[02:17.99]The bonds you buried under jokes
[02:19.59]were living parts of you.
[02:22.55]The damage did not disappear
[02:24.20]because the world looked fake.
[02:26.67]Every heart you called a puppet
[02:28.54]was a heart that you could break.
[02:31.14]You feared that they would leave you,
[02:32.86]so you made it hard to stay.
[02:35.87]You feared that you would hurt them,
[02:37.44]so you hurt them anyway.
[02:40.50]You feared they might discover
[02:41.85]someone frightened underneath,
[02:45.01]so you fed them the caricature
[02:47.59]and sharpened all its teeth.
[02:49.93]You made a courtroom of your chest.
[02:52.57]You made yourself the law.
[02:54.59]You sentenced every witness
[02:56.36]who could name the fear they saw.
[02:59.68]Purple rabbit, 
[03:00.92]purple rabbit,
[03:02.12]laugh, laugh, laugh.
[03:04.37]Purple rabbit, 
[03:05.45]purple rabbit,
[03:06.33]bite, bite, bite.
[03:08.45]Laugh first.
[03:09.40]Bite first.
[03:10.51]Leave first.
[03:11.73]Love became a crime.
[03:15.45]Leave them
[03:16.47]before they leave you behind.
[03:26.52]UNREACHABLE.
[03:27.51]UNTOUCHABLE.
[03:28.68]UNLOVABLE.
[03:30.14]That was not the verdict.
[03:33.75]That was what
[03:34.78]you taught yourself.
[03:36.20]The danger was not Caine.
[03:37.28]It was not the painted sky.
[03:39.52]It was someone looking at you
[03:41.28]without believing your disguise.
[03:44.83]Someone hearing panic
[03:46.17]under every cruel reply,
[03:48.92]seeing the rabbit clearly
[03:50.58]without laughing at the lie.
[03:53.23]So you made yourself unbearable.
[03:54.64]You gave them reasons to depart.
[03:57.64]Then you called their leaving proof
[03:59.89]that no one wanted your heart.
[04:02.31]You did not stop needing kindness.
[04:04.59]You just made it contraband.
[04:06.77]You broke every reaching finger,
[04:08.95]then complained there was no hand.
[04:12.11]“I hate you”
[04:13.58]meant
[04:14.55]“Please don’t leave me.”
[04:16.38]“I don’t care”
[04:17.77]meant
[04:18.95]“Please believe me.”
[04:20.99]“It was nothing”
[04:22.05]meant
[04:23.26]“It mattered.”
[04:25.37]“Go away”
[04:26.79]meant
[04:28.07]“Hold me
[04:29.22]before I shatter.”
[04:31.23]Laugh first.
[04:32.11]Bite first.
[04:33.16]Leave first.
[04:34.27]Do not let them see you bleed.
[04:39.83]Laugh first.
[04:41.04]Bite first.
[04:42.31]Leave first.
[04:43.42]If nobody can reach you,
[04:45.91]nobody can make you need.
[04:48.63]You punished every person
[04:49.92]who translated what you said.
[04:52.34]You buried every living thing
[04:53.85]to keep the frightened part unread.
[04:57.23]You learned to stay alive
[04:58.83]by killing everything that keeps us living:
[05:01.16]TO BE KNOWN.
[05:02.73]TO BE HELD.
[05:04.00]TO BE HEARD.
[05:05.16]TO BE FORGIVEN.
[05:06.42]You turned terror into a weapon.
[05:10.96]You aimed it at the others,
[05:15.93]the witnesses,
[05:18.08]the ones who loved you.
[05:20.34]AND THE WEAPON
[05:21.78]FORGOT
[05:22.96]THE ENEMY.
