[05:32.20]bite, bite, bite.
[05:34.50]Laugh first.
[05:35.36]Bite first.
[05:36.38]Leave first.
[05:37.58]Now there is no one inside.
[05:43.99]Purple rabbit, purple rabbit,
[05:45.77]love became a crime.
[05:49.49]Laugh first.
[05:50.47]The sentence
[05:51.55]learned your name tonight.
[05:53.47]Purple rabbit, 
[05:54.84]purple rabbit,
[05:55.97]you were never made of armour.
[05:58.41]You were only terrified.
[06:01.25]You did not stop needing love.
[06:05.90]You just made it
[06:07.73]illegal
[06:10.00]to survive.
[06:13.50]Heh…
